WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.968
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.037
You're here. You made it.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.070
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.507
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:08.708
Let's get to some news.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:11.010
Well, guys, today
the U.S. intelligence agencies

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.148
finished their review
on the origins of COVID-19.

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:17.049
Then, Americans said,
"Hold that thought.

00:00:17.049 --> 00:00:18.818
There's a new
'Spider-Man' trailer, y'all."

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.521
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.857
That's right, after a version
of the trailer leaked online,

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:27.226
Sony released the official
teaser trailer

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:29.162 line:0%
for "Spider-Man: No Way Home"

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:32.131 line:0%
and it already has
over 200 million views.

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:34.134
[ Murmuring ]
Yeah, fans are going nuts.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:35.402
People haven't been this excited

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:36.703
about a kid who lives
with his aunt

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.304
since "The Fresh Prince
of Bel-Air."

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.106
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.808
In the trailer, Spider-Man
visits Doctor Strange

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:45.678
and asks him to turn back time.

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:47.881
Then, President Biden shows up
and asks for the same thing.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.750
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.885
Speaking of new films,
Netflix just announced

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:55.254 line:0%
the release dates of 42 movies

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:58.557 line:0%
that are hitting the platform
by the end of this year.

00:00:58.557 --> 00:00:59.692
[ Oohing ]

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.093
Even the Hallmark Channel
was like,

00:01:01.093 --> 00:01:02.495
"Maybe should just
slow down a bit, you know?

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.164
[ Laughter ]
Like quality over quantity,"
yeah.

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:07.066
Forty-two new movies.

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.701
When they heard that,
Disney+ said, "Crap.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.837
Get some Avengers in front
of a greenscreen, now!"

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:12.572
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:15.675
Netflix also announced
all their holiday movies.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:17.343
-Whoo!
-Yeah, they were like,
Okay, Starbucks,

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.979
we see your pumpkin spice latte
in August

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.748
and raise you
'Single All the Way.'"

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.349
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:24.617
Well, guys,
as I mentioned today,

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:27.253 line:0%
the report on the origins
of COVID was completed

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:31.957 line:0%
and an unclassified version will
soon be released to the public.

00:01:31.957 --> 00:01:33.592
And, like everything
with this pandemic,

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:35.762
I'm sure Americans
will fully accept the truth

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:39.365
and it'll put all conspiracy
theories to rest, finally.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.168
[ Laughter and applause ]
I knew it. I just know it.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.537
It's really going to be great.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:47.073
Case closed.
-Yeah, the unclassified report

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:48.874
will come out in a few days,

00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:51.377
or sooner, if Sony
accidentally leaks it early.

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:52.678
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:54.880
Some more COVID news --
I saw that Pfizer

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:59.352
is changing the name
of their vaccine to Comirnaty.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:03.255
[ Smattering of laughter ]
Yeah, Comirnaty.

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:05.258
It's a combination of the terms

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:10.763
COVID-19, mRNA,
community, and immunity.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.531
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:13.833
-Okay.
-Sure.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.201
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.336
Let see how that's going
for everyone.

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:20.473 line:0%
-The vaccine has been known
as the Pfizer vaccine

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:23.342 line:0%
and will now be marketed
as "Co-mihr-nah-tee."

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:24.477 line:0%
-"Co-meer-natty."

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.479 line:0%
-Comirnaty.
-"Comir-notty."

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.447 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-"Co-meer- Co-meer-notty."

00:02:28.447 --> 00:02:29.849 line:0%
-"Co- Comir-netty."

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:31.350 line:0%
-"Corma-- Corminot.

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.452 line:0%
Comirna-tee."

00:02:33.452 --> 00:02:34.453 line:0%
-"Cuh-mare-uh-tay."

00:02:34.453 --> 00:02:35.922 line:0%
Well, I guess we'll figure out

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:37.423 line:0%
how they're going
to pronounce that.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.393
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.161
One anchor was like,
"Formerly known as the

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:43.429
'Puh-fizzer' vaccine."

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:45.131
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:46.466
Listen, if they really
wanted people to take it,

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:47.933
they should've just called it
White Claw.

00:02:47.933 --> 00:02:49.802
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.837
That's right, Pfizer announced
that they're renaming

00:02:51.837 --> 00:02:53.773
their vaccine Comirnaty,

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:55.541
which led to another
interesting announcement.

00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:56.809
Watch this.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.145
-This year, Johnson &amp; Johnson
has been so proud

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:02.114
to offer its very own
COVID-19 vaccine.

00:03:02.114 --> 00:03:04.416
And today,
we're even prouder to announce

00:03:04.416 --> 00:03:05.752
its brand-new name...

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.221
[ Laughter ]
That's right, the J&amp;J vaccine

00:03:09.221 --> 00:03:11.190
is now called
the Pfizer vaccine.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.391
Bye-bye, bad press.

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:13.826
Hello, rebrand.

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:16.796
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:17.897
[ Applause ]
-That's interesting.

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:19.364
That's a good name.

00:03:19.364 --> 00:03:20.766
It's a great name for it.

00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:24.137
[ Applause continues ]

00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:25.405
Well, this is going viral --

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:27.607
