[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:35.014
This is real.
Take a look at this.

00:03:37.249 --> 00:03:39.152
[ Laughter ]
He's at the table.

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:40.486
He's at the table, shaving.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:46.125
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:47.860
Then, Rudy left to do
a press conference

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.696
