Total Manscaping.

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:52.231
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.231 --> 00:03:54.700
Hey, get this --
I saw that Oscar Meyer

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.970 line:0%
